		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Sweet Naqiba. She would always call me &#8220;Dear Heart&#8221; just like my mother did. Naqiba would become so exalted that we had to stand on her feet so she didn&#8217;t float right out of her body&#8230;</p>
]]></content:encoded>
